---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="About" description="Cooper Mendoza — Finance student at UT Austin, McCombs School of Business.">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="about-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h1 class="about-title">Cooper Mendoza</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose about-body">
      <p>
        I'm a Finance student at the University of Texas at Austin,
        McCombs School of Business, Class of 2029. My focus is equity
        valuation, stock pitching, and investment analysis — the work of
        understanding what a business is actually worth and why.
      </p>

      <p>
        I'm an officer of <strong>Texas Equity Management (TEM)</strong>, a
        student-run investment fund at McCombs. We present stock pitches and
        portfolio updates to give our members real exposure to markets and the
        discipline of making a case in front of people who will push back on it.
      </p>

      <h2>Why this notebook</h2>
      <p>
        I started writing publicly because it forces a standard. A research note
        you're going to show someone has to be more honest than one that lives
        in a folder. The process of cleaning up thinking enough to publish it
        is most of the value.
      </p>
      <p>
        The research section is where I work through individual companies —
        business model, competitive position, unit economics. The book memos
        are reactions: what stuck, what I'd argue with, how my thinking changed.
      </p>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        I'm always interested in talking about companies, investing, or anything
        in the overlap. Find me on LinkedIn:
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/cooper-mendoza" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="linkedin-link">
          linkedin.com/in/cooper-mendoza →
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Page>

<style>
  .about-header {
    padding: var(--space-12) 0 var(--space-8);
  }

  .about-header .eyebrow { display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }

  .about-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: var(--size-2xl);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .about-body {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }

  .linkedin-link {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--size-sm);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
</style>
